              'The 240 expense claims are FICTIONAL and generated with seed 2026: a claim is queried if there is no receipt and the amount is over UGX 50,000, or the amount is over UGX 800,000, or it was filed more than 30 days late, with about 8% of labels flipped at random. Say so every time the table appears.',
